---
code: mark-hashcolon-malformed
when-fires: the new-grammar mark parser found a `#:` comment that looks like a mark-block but did not parse (`281` §9). oracle/predict/parser.rs fail_hashcolon.
why: 281 §9 graceful degradation: the hash-colon carrier is left a plain comment (never mis-erased) but diagnosed (Warning) so a broken one is never silently ignored.
